---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import IconLucideZap from '~icons/lucide/zap'
import { podcastConfig } from '@hn/config'

const description = `了解 ${podcastConfig.podcast.name} 如何使用 AI 技术生成播客内容，包括语音合成、内容生成和质量控制。`
---

<Layout
  title="AI 技术说明"
  description={description}
  type="website"
>
  <div class="max-w-175 mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-tx3 hover:text-tx1 transition-colors mb-8 no-underline"
    >
      ← 返回首页
    </a>

    <h1 class="font-serif-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-tx1 mb-3 leading-tight">
      AI 技术说明
    </h1>
    <p class="text-tx3 mb-10">了解 {podcastConfig.podcast.name} 背后的 AI 技术栈</p>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <!-- 透明声明 -->
      <section>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-sf-card border border-bd mb-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <IconLucideZap class="w-4 h-4 text-ac" />
            <span class="font-mono-label text-xs tracking-widest text-ac uppercase font-medium">
              透明声明
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-tx2 leading-[1.8]">
            本播客的所有内容均由 AI 生成，包括话题筛选、对话脚本编写、语音合成，以及 Show Notes 的整理。我们相信 AI 生成内容应该被透明地标注，因此在每一期节目和本网站的各个位置都有明确说明。
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 技术栈 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-mono-label text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-tx4 uppercase mb-4">
          完整技术栈
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <!-- 话题筛选 -->
          <div class="border-l-2 border-ac/30 pl-4">
            <h3 class="text-tx1 font-medium text-base mb-2">1. 话题筛选</h3>
            <div class="text-sm text-tx3 leading-[1.8] space-y-2">
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">数据源：</span>通过 Hacker News API 获取首页新闻和评论
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">AI 模型：</span>longCat-Flash-Chat
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">筛选标准：</span>评估新闻价值、讨论深度、技术相关性和话题多样性
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">输出：</span>每日精选 6-8 条最值得讨论的新闻
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 对话生成 -->
          <div class="border-l-2 border-ac/30 pl-4">
            <h3 class="text-tx1 font-medium text-base mb-2">2. 对话脚本生成</h3>
            <div class="text-sm text-tx3 leading-[1.8] space-y-2">
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">AI 模型：</span>mistral-large-latest
              </p>
              <!-- <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">主播人设：</span>
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-4 space-y-1">
                <li class="relative pl-4 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-1.5 before:h-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-ac/40">
                  <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">{podcastConfig.hosts.female.name}：</span>{podcastConfig.hosts.female.personality}
                </li>
                <li class="relative pl-4 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-1.5 before:h-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-ac/40">
                  <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">{podcastConfig.hosts.male.name}：</span>{podcastConfig.hosts.male.personality}
                </li>
              </ul> -->
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">对话风格：</span>自然、口语化，带有适度的幽默和批判性思考
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">内容来源：</span>新闻原文 + HN 评论区精华讨论
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 语音合成 -->
          <div class="border-l-2 border-ac/30 pl-4">
            <h3 class="text-tx1 font-medium text-base mb-2">3. 语音合成</h3>
            <div class="text-sm text-tx3 leading-[1.8] space-y-2">
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">TTS 引擎：</span>Azure Text-to-Speech
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">语音模型：</span>
              </p>
              <ul class="ml-4 space-y-1">
                <li class="relative pl-4 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-1.5 before:h-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-ac/40">
                  <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">{podcastConfig.hosts.female.name}：</span>{podcastConfig.hosts.female.voice}
                </li>
                <li class="relative pl-4 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-1.5 before:h-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-ac/40">
                  <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">{podcastConfig.hosts.male.name}：</span>{podcastConfig.hosts.male.voice}
                </li>
              </ul>
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">音频处理：</span>自动添加背景音乐、淡入淡出效果和对话间隔
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">输出格式：</span>MP3，比特率 128kbps
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Show Notes -->
          <div class="border-l-2 border-ac/30 pl-4">
            <h3 class="text-tx1 font-medium text-base mb-2">4. Show Notes 生成</h3>
            <div class="text-sm text-tx3 leading-[1.8] space-y-2">
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">AI 模型：</span>{podcastConfig.ai.defaultModel}
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">内容：</span>自动提取新闻标题、链接、HN 讨论链接和简短描述
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">格式：</span>结构化 Markdown，便于网站展示
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 网站与托管 -->
          <div class="border-l-2 border-ac/30 pl-4">
            <h3 class="text-tx1 font-medium text-base mb-2">5. 网站与托管</h3>
            <div class="text-sm text-tx3 leading-[1.8] space-y-2">
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">前端框架：</span>Astro + Tailwind CSS
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">音频存储：</span>Cloudflare R2
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">网站托管：</span>Cloudflare Worker
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">RSS Feed：</span>标准 Podcast RSS 2.0 格式，支持 iTunes 标签
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="border-t border-bd"></div>

      <!-- 工作流程 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-mono-label text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-tx4 uppercase mb-4">
          自动化工作流程
        </h2>
        <div class="text-base text-tx2 leading-[1.85] space-y-4">
          <p>整个播客制作流程完全自动化，每日执行：</p>
          <ol class="space-y-3 ml-4">
            <li class="relative pl-6 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:content-['1.'] before:text-ac before:font-medium">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">抓取数据：</span>从 HN API 获取当日首页新闻和热门评论
            </li>
            <li class="relative pl-6 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:content-['2.'] before:text-ac before:font-medium">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">AI 筛选：</span>评估新闻价值，选出 6-8 条最值得讨论的话题
            </li>
            <li class="relative pl-6 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:content-['3.'] before:text-ac before:font-medium">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">生成蓝图：</span>根据新闻内容和评论，生成两位主播的对话蓝图，包含主要观点和讨论结构
            </li>
            <li class="relative pl-6 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:content-['3.'] before:text-ac before:font-medium">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">生成脚本：</span>根据新闻内容和评论，生成两位主播的对话脚本
            </li>
            <li class="relative pl-6 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:content-['4.'] before:text-ac before:font-medium">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">语音合成：</span>将脚本转换为自然语音，添加音效和背景音乐
            </li>
            <li class="relative pl-6 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:content-['5.'] before:text-ac before:font-medium">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">生成 Show Notes：</span>提取关键信息，生成结构化的节目笔记
            </li>
            <li class="relative pl-6 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:content-['6.'] before:text-ac before:font-medium">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">发布上线：</span>上传音频到 R2，更新网站内容，推送 RSS Feed
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="border-t border-bd"></div>

      <!-- 质量控制 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-mono-label text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-tx4 uppercase mb-4">
          质量控制
        </h2>
        <div class="text-base text-tx2 leading-[1.85] space-y-4">
          <p>虽然内容由 AI 生成，但我们仍然注重质量：</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 ml-4">
            <li class="relative pl-4 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-1.5 before:h-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-ac/40">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">事实核查：</span>AI 生成的内容基于真实新闻和评论，不会编造事实
            </li>
            <li class="relative pl-4 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-1.5 before:h-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-ac/40">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">多样性：</span>确保每期节目涵盖不同类型的技术话题
            </li>
            <li class="relative pl-4 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-1.5 before:h-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-ac/40">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">可读性：</span>对话脚本经过优化，确保自然流畅
            </li>
            <li class="relative pl-4 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-1.5 before:h-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-ac/40">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">音频质量：</span>语音合成使用高质量模型，音效处理专业
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="border-t border-bd"></div>

      <!-- 局限性 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-mono-label text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-tx4 uppercase mb-4">
          已知局限性
        </h2>
        <div class="text-base text-tx2 leading-[1.85] space-y-4">
          <p>作为 AI 生成的播客，我们也有一些局限：</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 ml-4">
            <li class="relative pl-4 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-1.5 before:h-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-tx4">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">缺乏真实情感：</span>虽然对话自然，但缺少人类主播的真实情感和临场反应
            </li>
            <li class="relative pl-4 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-1.5 before:h-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-tx4">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">深度有限：</span>AI 的理解深度可能不如资深技术专家
            </li>
            <li class="relative pl-4 before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.6em] before:w-1.5 before:h-1.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-tx4">
              <span class="text-tx1 font-medium">语音合成：</span>虽然接近真人，但仍可能有轻微的机械感
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="border-t border-bd"></div>

      <!-- 开源 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-mono-label text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-tx4 uppercase mb-4">
          开源与透明
        </h2>
        <div class="text-base text-tx2 leading-[1.85] space-y-4">
          <p>
            我们计划将播客生成的核心代码开源，让更多人了解 AI 播客的制作流程。如果你对技术细节感兴趣，欢迎关注我们的 <a href={podcastConfig.social.github} class="text-ac hover:underline">GitHub 仓库</a>。
          </p>
          <p>
            如果你发现内容错误或有任何建议，欢迎通过 <a href="/about" class="text-ac hover:underline">关于页面</a> 联系我们。
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-6 border-t border-bd text-center text-xs text-tx4">
      <a href="/about" class="text-ac hover:underline">返回关于页面</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
